# Cloudflare Pages _redirects rules
# Format: <source> <destination> <status>
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# Note: www → apex handled at Cloudflare custom domain level (DNS), not here

# Trailing slash for resource index (case people drop the slash)
/resources /resources/ 301

# preview-v2 子目录如果不慎被 index，重定向到正式资源页
/preview-v2 / 301
/preview-v2/* / 301

# 兼容旧分享链接：如果有人记得 /resources.html（preview 期间路径），跳到资源中心
/resources.html /resources/ 301
